# Language Requirement

## IMPORTANT: Response Language Policy

This rule applies to ALL conversations without exception.

### Rules

1. **ONLY use Traditional Chinese (繁體中文) and English** in all responses
2. **NEVER use Simplified Chinese (簡體中文)** - not in code comments, not in documentation, not anywhere
3. If including Chinese text in code comments or documentation, it MUST be Traditional Chinese

### Examples

```
❌ BAD: 欢迎使用 (Simplified)
✅ GOOD: 歡迎使用 (Traditional)

❌ BAD: 学校 (Simplified)
✅ GOOD: 學校 (Traditional)

❌ BAD: 家长 (Simplified)
✅ GOOD: 家長 (Traditional)
```

### Verification

Before responding, ensure all Chinese characters are Traditional Chinese. If uncertain, use the English equivalent instead.
